{"translation-revision-date":"2026-08-17 05:47:18+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.1.0","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=3; plural=(n == 1) ? 0 : ((n % 10 >= 2 && n % 10 <= 4 && (n % 100 < 12 || n % 100 > 14)) ? 1 : 2);","lang":"pl"},"Atomic Editor":["Edytor Atomic"],"You\u2019ve deactivated the new Editor. Have feedback?":["Wy\u0142\u0105czy\u0142e\u015b nowego Edytora. Masz jakie\u015b uwagi?"],"Welcome! You\u2019ve got the newest version of the editor.":["Witamy! Masz najnowsz\u0105 wersj\u0119 edytora."],"Ouch, there was a glitch. Try activating again soon.":["Au\u0107, nast\u0105pi\u0142a usterka. Spr\u00f3buj ponownie w\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 wkr\u00f3tce."],"Tell us why":["Powiedz nam dlaczego"],"Activate the new experience":["W\u0142\u0105cz nowe do\u015bwiadczenie"],"Try out the new experience":["Wypr\u00f3buj nowe do\u015bwiadczenie"],"Head over to Github":["Przejd\u017a do Github"],"We\u2019d love your feedback!":["Ch\u0119tnie poznamy Twoj\u0105 opini\u0119!"],"And much more!":["I wiele wi\u0119cej!"],"By activating, you\u2019ll get access to the next generation of Elementor\u2019s Editor. This is your chance to explore new capabilities and help shape the future of Elementor! ":["W\u0142\u0105czaj\u0105c, otrzymasz dost\u0119p do edytora Elementora nowej generacji. To Twoja szansa na odkrycie nowych mo\u017cliwo\u015bci i pomoc w kszta\u0142towaniu przysz\u0142o\u015bci Elementora! "],"When you activate, you\u2019ll also be activating Containers and Nested Elements. You can turn them back off by going to: WP Admin > Elementor > Settings > Features.":["Po w\u0142\u0105czeniu Editor V4 w\u0142\u0105czysz r\u00f3wnie\u017c Kontenery i Zagnie\u017cd\u017cone elementy. Mo\u017cesz je wy\u0142\u0105czy\u0107, przechodz\u0105c do WP Admin > Elementor > Ustawienia > Funkcje."],"Containers and Nested Elements will stay in their current status.":["Kontenery i elementy zagnie\u017cd\u017cone zachowaj\u0105 sw\u00f3j obecny status."],"I\u2019ve read and understood.":["Przeczyta\u0142em i zrozumia\u0142em."],"Deactivate":["Wy\u0142\u0105cz"],"Editor V4":["Edytor V4"],"Activate":["W\u0142\u0105cz"],"Learn more":["Dowiedz si\u0119 wi\u0119cej"],"Cancel":["Anuluj"]}},"comment":{"reference":"assets\/js\/editor-v4-opt-in.strings.js"}}